config FB_EXYNOS9810_DPU
	bool "Exynos9810 DPU (DECON-F/DPP/DSIM) fbdev driver (work in progress)"
	depends on FB && OF && ARM64
	depends on ARCH_EXYNOS || COMPILE_TEST
	help
	  Port of the Samsung 4.9 dpu_9810 fbdev driver (DECON, DPP, DSIM)
	  with the ioctl ABI used by the Exynos vendor HWC. The port is in
	  progress: at present only the ioctl ABI definitions and their
	  compile-time checks are built. See
	  Documentation/crownlte/display-port.md.
